ly: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  品种：瑰夏 Gesha\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理方式：水洗 Washed\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理过程：浮选-去除果皮果肉-干发酵44小时-晾晒19天\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  主产季：8-11月；次产季：3-7月\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; visibility: visible;\">\n  烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：花香，黄柠檬，橙子，蜂蜜甜，绿茶感\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  Floral, Lemon, Orange，Honeyed sweet, Green tea-like\n </span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" style=\"height: auto !important; text-align: center; width: 578px !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(123, 12, 0); font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  烘焙度：深度 Dark Roasted\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：黑巧克力，柚子，焦糖，非常柔顺\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  Dark choco, Pomelo, Caramel, Mild sweet\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q8U1djJVUicJSsH6vYpn3LTcm6fwLibYKMI7k6ZUHsBLibEdhwrywa6JKFOMH6kI11wibZ6TSYrpjJzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" style=\"width: 578px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QsIA9kUXHKZdRI8OvImplKeDtxodLE8W6gSnESyribQuZbG5ia5zFeJsSSwukAae6LicDXHhGAhuv8w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n    关于白山庄园\n   </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n  白山庄园位于慧兰省的圣阿道夫区域, 庄园创立于80年代，现在由第三代Rodrigo Sanchez负责，庄园主要种植粉波旁，瑰夏品种。\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n  白山是一个非常有实验探索精神的庄园，Rodrigo与妻子和一个太阳能科技应用团队一直不断的尝试不同的技术应用在处理加工，发酵，晾晒环节，同时他们也与欧洲的专做肥料的Yara团队一起针对庄园不同的地块与品种来应用不同的肥料来改善土壤。\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n  白山一年有两个产季，高峰期分别是6-7月与10-11月，也正式由于产季的分散，是的庄园在每次产季有足够的时间去做多种处理方式的批次。\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n   这个批次是我们将传统水洗，冷冲击水洗和一个叫做3相水洗的批次混拼的一个特定产品，我们命名 “三重奏 TRIO”，希望大家能喝到白山瑰夏水洗处理的细腻和美好\n  </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  关于冷冲击（低温发酵））水洗 Cold Washed， 是白山从2015年开始实验的一个处理方式，用了2年时间庄园摸索了一套自己的低温发酵处理过程\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n    鲜果（Brix28）去皮\n   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n    装袋放入冷库低温静置发酵（10-13摄氏度）3-6天左右\n   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n    室外自然晾晒3天\n   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n    转入遮阴棚晾晒20-25天\n   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n    静置20天左右脱壳测样决定出口\n   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  低温发酵会使得甜感的部分会更为的饱满，使得果酸更为的顺口，整体合起来酸甜苦与香气更加细腻和谐。\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 12px;\">\n  部分内容参考：https://medium.com/ally-coffee/behind-the-scenes-at-finca-monteblanco-dc0e4ef20976\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 12px;\">\n  https://www.allycoffee.com/coffees/monteblanco-gesha-cold-fermentation/\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 12px;\">\n  https://allyopen.com/blogs/get-inspired/continuing-innovation-in-coffee-processing-at-finca-monteblanco\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\" style=\"height: auto !important; width: 388px !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>",
